	<key>readme</key>
	<string>## Setup

Requires Apple Silicon macOS and Alfred 5 with Powerpack. Enter your Trello API key, token and inbox list ID below.

Use `tin Buy more packaging material` to capture a card. Use `tin-update` to check GitHub Releases. Failed captures copy your text to the clipboard.

No Node.js, npm or Deno installation is needed. Credentials are stored locally in Alfred preferences.

See the repository README for configuration help.</string>
